-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §14 ימי עבודה בשבוע: a full-position teacher
-- works five days a week, also where the school runs six; one who worked
-- four days before the reform in a five-day school may, with the
-- principal's consent, go on working four, if no day exceeds nine hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `14 ימי עבודה בשבוע`

@ref akn:art_14__para_a
`working days a week in a full position` MEANS 5

-- (ב): the permission and its condition.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b
GIVEN `in a school with a five-day week` IS A BOOLEAN
      `worked four days before the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the principal consents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `longest day in the timetable, in hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may go on working four days` `in a school with a five-day week` `worked four days before the reform` `the principal consents` `longest day in the timetable, in hours` IF
        `in a school with a five-day week`
    AND `worked four days before the reform`
    AND `the principal consents`
    AND `longest day in the timetable, in hours` AT MOST 9

#ASSERT `may go on working four days` TRUE TRUE TRUE 9
#ASSERT NOT `may go on working four days` TRUE TRUE TRUE 9.5
#ASSERT NOT `may go on working four days` FALSE TRUE TRUE 8
